### List & Create Availability / Blackout Rules
GET {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Availability Rule
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wednesday Coaching Window",
  "targetKind": "Service",
  "ruleType": "RecurringWindow",
  "bookableServiceId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
  "dayOfWeek": "Wednesday",
  "startLocalTime": "09:00:00",
  "endLocalTime": "17:00:00",
  "timeZoneId": "UTC"
}

### Delete Availability Rule
DELETE {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/rules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Query Conflict-Free Available Slots
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/public/slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetKind": "Service",
  "targetIdOrSlug": "career-coaching-1on1",
  "rangeStartUtc": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "rangeEndUtc": "2026-12-08T00:00:00Z",
  "requestedQuantity": 1
}

### Acquire TTL Slot Reservation Hold
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/public/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetKind": "Service",
  "targetIdOrSlug": "career-coaching-1on1",
  "slotStartUtc": "2026-12-02T14:00:00Z",
  "quantity": 1,
  "holdTtlMinutes": 10
}

### Preview Booking Pricing Quote
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/public/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetKind": "Service",
  "targetIdOrSlug": "career-coaching-1on1",
  "slotStartUtc": "2026-12-02T14:00:00Z",
  "quantity": 1,
  "explicitMembershipTier": "Gold"
}

### Confirm Service or Resource Booking
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/public/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetKind": "Service",
  "targetIdOrSlug": "career-coaching-1on1",
  "slotStartUtc": "2026-12-02T14:00:00Z",
  "customerName": "Casey Morgan",
  "customerEmail": "casey.morgan@example.org",
  "quantity": 1,
  "explicitMembershipTier": "Gold"
}

### Lookup Booking Confirmation
GET {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/public/confirmations/BKG-20261125-123456

### Self-Service Cancel Booking
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/public/confirmations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015",
  "reason": "Rescheduling to next week"
}

### Query Coordinator Calendar Bookings
GET {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expire Stale Slot Holds
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/holds/expire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Staff Coordinator Cancel Booking
POST {{host}}/api/commerce/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015",
  "reason": "Facility maintenance override"
}
